      ]
    }
  },
  "writing_rules": [
    "Formation registries contain bounded aggregate operational formations, not exact-person rosters.",
    "Every explicit formation headcount is a conserved subset of the source force deployed personnel. Named consequential people remain exact person owners and are not added twice.",
    "Components are internal capability/accounting groups. Do not create one mutable file per ordinary squad or soldier.",
    "Inline formation tendencies are optional causal overrides only. Normal tendencies are derived from personnel-weighted component tendency_profile_ref values."
  ]
}
